    "_postman_id": "da9ad034-f32b-4bed-a601-d396eb79aeb6",
    "name": "Microsoft Windows 10 WinUI API",
    "description": "Modern native UI framework for building Windows desktop applications with the Fluent Design System. Based on the Microsoft.UI.Xaml namespace, WinUI provides XAML-based controls, high-performance rendering, and supports both C# and C++ development. Key areas include controls (NavigationView, TreeView, InfoBar, ProgressRing), layout (Grid, StackPanel, RelativePanel), styling (themes, brushes, animations), and input handling.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Microsoft Developer Support",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
